WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.962
A crack under chemistry software.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.823
Three electrons, two equal nuclei.

3
00:00:04.973 --> 00:00:08.848
Can independent electrons in some potential reproduce its density?

4
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.168
Build this exact molecule; no potential makes simpler electrons match its density.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.333
Claimed: this density cannot be reproduced.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.935
No Lean check.
